          "page_01": "<b>JrTrack</b><span>Wiki</span>",
          "page_02": "Shop JrTrack",
          "cw_hero_01": "All the details",
          "cw_hero_02": "JrTrack <span>Wiki</span>",
          "cw_hero_03": "Every feature on the watch and in the app, taken apart and put back together. How HaloGPS finds them, what SafeCore does in an emergency, how School-Fi knows it is a school day, what Cosmo Mobile costs. Read the parts you care about, or all of it.",
          "cw_hero_04": "<b>12</b> features",
