          "help_07": "Already own one",
          "help_08": "The full user guide",
          "help_09": "Reach for More.",
          "page_05": "Battery life varies with settings, signal strength, and usage. 24+ hours reflects default settings in Cosmo lab testing. JrTrack Pro battery capacity and runtime figures are preliminary.",
          "page_06": "JrTrack Pro is 3 ATM rated for water, equivalent to 30 meters (98 feet) of static pressure. Suitable for rain, splashes, and handwashing. Not a swimming or diving rating. JrTrack 5 and JrTrack 5 SE are IP68 rated to 1.5 meters.",
          "page_07": "Cellular service requires an active Cosmo Mobile plan. Calling available in the US, Canada, and Mexico. Texting available in the US and Canada.",
